      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-08-12T15:32:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The destruction overrides the cards effect. A destroyed card can't have an effect. Consider that things like Exploding wagon explicity say they stay in play after destruction to have an effect as an exception to the rule</p>",
