      "created_at": "2016-08-12T15:34:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>That’s the way it is. It is similar to Haka at 1 hp hitting Baron Blade at 1 hp with Backlashfield out. Haka Wins.</p>\n<p>I might be able to explain it, but others kight disagree. The sinple answer is damage triggers don’t happen when something is destroyed, since it is destroyed.</p>",
