      "id": 181112,
      "name": "bluedarky",
      "username": "bluedarky",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-08-12T19:01:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep, if the card says on destruction, then it stays in play whilst it's effect resolves. &nbsp;If it says on damage, then it leaves before it's effect resolves.</p><p>So in order -&nbsp;</p><p>1. Card takes damage that destroys it.<br>2. Effects from the cards destruction resolve.<br>3. Card is destroyed.<br>4. Other effects on the card fail to resolve as it is no longer in play.</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:05:47.375Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.0,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 15540,
      "topic_slug": "damage-that-destroys-constructs",
      "display_username": "bluedarky",
      "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_name": "playtesters",
      "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
      "flair_bg_color": "",
