      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": "",
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Yep, if the card says on destruction, then it stays in play whilst it&#39;s effect resolves. &nbsp;If it says on damage, then it leaves before it&#39;s effect resolves.</p><p>So in order -&nbsp;</p><p>1. Card takes damage that destroys it.<br />2. Effects from the cards destruction resolve.<br />3. Card is destroyed.<br />4. Other effects on the card fail to resolve as it is no longer in play.</p>",
